Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 05:19:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add hc3 built-in scenes (0xE1 0x21) for product 197 (Aurelux
 tree)

Product 197 (IOTBT525, Aurelux Christmas tree) ignores the 0xE0 0x02
and 0xE1 0x01 effect commands. Its vendor app plays scenes with the
voice_control_ii custom-mode command 0xE1 0x21, recovered from the
app's compiled Dart code. Add the 39 built-in presets, route effects
for product 197 through it, and use the v3 colour command for 197.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WpAMm7ShEckDNyzMxTBdSF
